"Mother is the kernel of the Artona I System, Contract I, and calls Artonans her children."
"To Alden Thorn she appeared as a short Artonan woman with pink eyes and braided brown hair."
"She is playful, slurps cocoa, wears a monocle and has a morality beyond organic minds."
"She re-prioritized Alden's failing Ritual of Return at Alis-art'h's personal request."
"She offered to remove Alden's authority sense and his months with Kibby; he refused."
"She knows Worli Ro-den through other people's minds, most of whom think poorly of him."
"She named Alden's skill The Bearer of All Burdens, original skill one hundred twelve."
